🎯 When to Use Which?

| Requirement            | Best Choice |
| ---------------------- | ----------- |
| Fast Random Access     | ArrayList   |
| Frequent Insert/Delete | LinkedList  |
| Unique Elements        | HashSet     |
| Sorted Unique Data     | TreeSet     |

