⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using ArrayList for heavy insertions
❌ Expecting HashSet to preserve insertion order
❌ Using TreeSet with non-comparable objects
❌ Ignoring Generics

```java
ArrayList list = new ArrayList();
```

